{"seq":2,"slug":"undo-redo","title":"撤销与重做","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/rich-text-editor-engineering/features/undo-redo","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"撤销与重做\">撤销与重做</h1><p>按下 Ctrl+Z，光标跳回上一步、刚删掉的那段话又回来了——这个动作用户每天做几十次，习以为常到几乎不会注意它。但在富文本编辑器里，撤销重做是出了名的「看着简单、做起来满是陷阱」的功能。陷阱不在单人场景，而在两个地方：撤销的<strong>粒度</strong>（一次撤销应该撤掉多少），以及多人协同下撤销的<strong>归属</strong>（撤销到底该撤掉谁的操作）。后者把一个本可以用数组栈搞定的功能，逼成了与<a href=\"collaborative-editing\">协同编辑</a>深度纠缠的精巧机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>撤销系统的地基，是第二章定下的那条性质：每个<a href=\"../model/operations-commands\">步骤都是可逆的</a>。若步骤 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 把文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则存在逆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^{-1}(D&#x27;) = D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。撤销，本质上就是把历史操作的逆按相反顺序重新应用一遍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户操作产生事务] --&gt; B[计算事务的逆]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逆压入 undo 栈]&#10;    A --&gt; D[清空 redo 栈]&#10;    E[按 Ctrl+Z] --&gt; F[弹出 undo 栈顶]&#10;    F --&gt; G[应用该逆事务]&#10;    G --&gt; H[其对应正向事务压入 redo 栈]&#10;    I[按 Ctrl+Y] --&gt; J[弹出 redo 栈顶]&#10;    J --&gt; K[重新应用正向事务]\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户操作产生事务] --&gt; B[计算事务的逆]\n    B --&gt; C[逆压入 undo 栈]\n    A --&gt; D[清空 redo 栈]\n    E[按 Ctrl+Z] --&gt; F[弹出 undo 栈顶]\n    F --&gt; G[应用该逆事务]\n    G --&gt; H[其对应正向事务压入 redo 栈]\n    I[按 Ctrl+Y] --&gt; J[弹出 redo 栈顶]\n    J --&gt; K[重新应用正向事务]</pre><p>下表对比三种撤销模型，从单人到协同逐级复杂：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>撤销什么</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>关键挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性栈</td>\n<td>全文档最近一步</td>\n<td>单人编辑</td>\n<td>粒度合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组栈</td>\n<td>一组被合并的操作</td>\n<td>单人，优化体验</td>\n<td>何时分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性/协同撤销</td>\n<td>仅本地用户的操作</td>\n<td>多人协同</td>\n<td>撤销需变换过他人操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最朴素的线性栈在单人场景完全够用：每个事务计算出逆事务压入 undo 栈，撤销即弹栈应用、并把正向版本压入 redo 栈；任何新操作都清空 redo 栈（因为分支历史已失效）。复杂度全都来自后两种模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撤销的粒度-合并与边界\">撤销的粒度：合并与边界</h2><p>如果每敲一个字符都生成一个独立的撤销点，用户按一次 Ctrl+Z 只能退回一个字——这显然不符合直觉。人们期望「撤销」以<strong>语义单元</strong>为粒度：连续输入的一串字算一步，一次粘贴算一步，一次格式调整算一步。</p>\n<p>实现这种粒度靠<strong>操作合并</strong>（coalescing）：当新事务与上一个事务「同类且连续」时，把它合并进上一个撤销点而非新建。判定「同类且连续」的常见规则有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两次都是在相邻位置的连续输入，且时间间隔小于阈值（如 500 毫秒）。</li>\n<li>中途没有发生选区跳跃（用户点了别处，说明开启了新的编辑意图）。</li>\n<li>操作类型相同（连续删除可合并，但「删除后接着输入」应断开）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function shouldMerge(prev, next, now) {&#10;  if (now - prev.time &gt; 500) return false; // 间隔太久，断开&#10;  if (prev.type !== next.type) return false; // 类型不同，断开&#10;  if (selectionJumped(prev, next)) return false; // 选区跳过，断开&#10;  return true; // 合并进同一撤销点&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function shouldMerge(prev, next, now) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (now - prev.time > 500) return false; // 间隔太久，断开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (prev.type !== next.type) return false; // 类型不同，断开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (selectionJumped(prev, next)) return false; // 选区跳过，断开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return true; // 合并进同一撤销点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>合并规则的微妙之处在于「断点」的把握：断得太碎用户嫌撤销不够爽快，断得太粗一次撤销退回太多让人心慌。这种体验调校没有标准答案，是各<a href=\"../ecosystem/editor-frameworks\">编辑器框架</a>长期打磨的细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协同下的撤销-到底撤谁的\">协同下的撤销：到底撤谁的？</h2><p>把撤销放进多人文档，线性栈立刻崩溃。设想 A 和 B 共同编辑，A 在第 5 行加粗，B 在第 20 行删了一段。此时 A 按 Ctrl+Z，期望发生什么？答案几乎一定是：<strong>撤掉 A 自己的加粗，而绝不能动 B 删的那段</strong>。这就是协同撤销的第一原则——撤销是<strong>本地的</strong>，只针对当前用户自己产生的操作。</p>\n<p>但「只撤自己的操作」立刻引出一个棘手问题。A 要撤销的那个加粗操作，是基于「当时的文档」产生的；可在 A 按下 Ctrl+Z 的此刻，文档已经被 B 的删除改过了。如果直接套用当初记录的逆操作，它引用的位置可能已经错位甚至失效。</p>\n<p>解决之道正是<a href=\"collaborative-editing\">协同编辑</a>里那套变换机制：撤销前，要把记录在 undo 栈里的逆操作，<strong>变换过</strong>自该操作以来发生的所有他人操作，使其位置对齐到当前文档。形式上，若 A 的原操作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、其后他人操作集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{b_1, b_2, \\dots\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，则真正要应用的不是简单的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依次经各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变换后的版本。这意味着协同撤销系统必须持续追踪「我的某个历史操作，经历了哪些他人操作的洗礼」。</p>\n<p>这正是为什么本篇被排在协同之后：撤销在单人场景只是数据结构练习，一旦进入协同，它就成了操作变换的又一个应用场景，复用同一套数学。ProseMirror 的 <code>prosemirror-history</code>、Yjs 的 <code>UndoManager</code> 都是按这个思路实现的——后者还允许配置「哪些来源的操作算作可撤销范围」，从而支持「撤销某用户某次会话的改动」这类高级需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撤销与选区-模式的协同\">撤销与选区、模式的协同</h2><p>一次好的撤销不只恢复文档内容，还要恢复<strong>选区</strong>。用户撤销一次删除，期望被删的文字回来、且光标落在合理的位置（通常是恢复内容的末尾或原选区处）。因此撤销栈里存的不只是逆步骤，还有「撤销后选区应当变成什么」——这与<a href=\"../model/operations-commands\">操作与命令</a>中事务携带选区变化是同一设计的延续。</p>\n<p>撤销也必须尊重<a href=\"../model/schema-constraints\">模式约束</a>。理论上逆操作应用后文档一定回到曾经合法的旧状态，但在协同变换的搅动下，变换后的逆操作落到当前文档上，有可能产生模式违规，此时仍要走规范化兜底。这再次印证了第二章那套基础设施的价值：撤销、协同、模式不是三个孤立功能，而是共享同一个操作与约束核心的三种表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>撤销的地基是步骤的可逆性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^{-1}(s(D)) = D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>：撤销即把历史操作的逆按反序重放，新操作清空 redo 栈。</li>\n<li>单人撤销只需线性栈；体验的关键是按语义单元合并操作（连续输入合并、选区跳跃/类型变化断开），断点把握靠长期调校。</li>\n<li>协同撤销的第一原则是「只撤本地用户自己的操作」，这迫使撤销复用<a href=\"collaborative-editing\">协同编辑</a>的变换机制——逆操作须变换过其后所有他人操作才能正确落地。</li>\n<li>撤销要同时恢复选区，并在协同变换后仍尊重<a href=\"../model/schema-constraints\">模式约束</a>，必要时靠规范化兜底。</li>\n<li>撤销、协同、模式共享同一个<a href=\"../model/operations-commands\">操作核心</a>，是第二章基础设施开花结果的又一例证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"撤销与重做","id":"撤销与重做"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"撤销的粒度：合并与边界","id":"撤销的粒度-合并与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"协同下的撤销：到底撤谁的？","id":"协同下的撤销-到底撤谁的"},{"level":2,"text":"撤销与选区、模式的协同","id":"撤销与选区-模式的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协同编辑与 OT/CRDT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/rich-text-editor-engineering/features/collaborative-editing"},"next":{"title":"插件与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/rich-text-editor-engineering/features/plugins-extensions"}}